+## Rejected alternatives
+- Two plans, with new nodes on `ui.dag.yaml` for Docket and bug-001 plus small feat plans for the API version and the guides. David asked for one plan, and #122 made one plan able to carry API and Docket nodes.
+- One node per recommendation (18 nodes). Several share a file, a screen or a cause. N2's four all live in `RequestsDrawer` and the workbench screens, and would conflict as four PRs.
+- One workbench node for N2 and N3 together. Twelve findings over three screens and five rules make a review too large to judge. N3 depends on N2 instead, so the two never conflict.
+- Running bug-001 as drafted, beside this plan. It would leave two plans touching `SellPolicyRequest` and break one-feature-at-a-time. N5 absorbs it, and its draft is deleted at approval.
